      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220164/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add ground beef into the skillet; cook and stir until crumbly and completely browned, 7 to 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7ESWjFuGtAkW8k9wBTtvP628ekw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/220164-ClassicCubanStylePicadillo-ddfms-Step3-0233-dee434033ca340ec9abc0f69bf1011d5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220164/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir tomato sauce, olives, raisins, capers, cumin, sazon seasoning, sugar, and salt into the ground beef mixture. Cover the skillet, reduce heat to low, and cook until the mixture is heated through, 5 to 10 minutes.",
